= Lyman Trumbull

Lyman Trumbull of Illinois is one of the nation's foremost constitutional scholars and legislators. A longtime advocate for civil rights, judicial independence, and the rule of law, Trumbull has played a defining role in shaping Reconstruction legislation. As a leading <span style="color: #DAA520;">**Liberal Republican**</span>, he favors principled government and constitutional reform over partisan politics.

